{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:KnotsParticlesConfinement.CategoricalProton","@type":"LeanModule","name":"KnotsParticlesConfinement.CategoricalProton","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.NormNum"],"declarations":11,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.proton_mass_from_substrate","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.proton_mass_from_substrate","kind":"theorem","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/categorical-proton.lean#L72-L74","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.proton_mass_from_substrate_axiom","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.proton_mass_from_substrate_axiom","kind":"axiom","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/categorical-proton.lean#L62-L70","doc":"**External axiom (§3b-cond pattern): proton_mass_from_substrate.**\n\nAuto-extracted from the single-sorry theorem body in this file.\nEncodes the categorical content pending Mathlib infrastructure\nor a structure-tightening refactor.\n\nSee the theorem docstring below for the cited reference. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.proton_mass","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.proton_mass","kind":"def","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/categorical-proton.lean#L49-L56","doc":"The proton mass as a function of the substrate parameter q.\nm_𝔭(q) = S_uu(q) + 2 · S_ud(q), where the pair Skein masses\nS_uu and S_ud are determined by the Borromean volume and\ncrossing energy at q. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.q₀_gt_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.q₀_gt_one","kind":"theorem","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/categorical-proton.lean#L46-L47","doc":"q₀ > 1. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.q₀","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.q₀","kind":"def","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/categorical-proton.lean#L41-L44","doc":"The CODATA substrate parameter q₀ ≈ 1.1097, the unique root q > 1\nof `(1 - q⁻¹)² = Vol(4₁)/(m_μ/m_e)`.\nSee `QOU.Experimental.LocalSubstrateQ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.CategoricalProton.chirality","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.CategoricalProton.chirality","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/categorical-proton.lean#L35-L35","doc":"Positive crossing chirality (electric charge = +1). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.CategoricalProton.mass","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.CategoricalProton.mass","kind":"def","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/categorical-proton.lean#L33-L33","doc":"Mass = S_uu + 2·S_ud. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.CategoricalProton.skein_ud","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.CategoricalProton.skein_ud","kind":"def","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/categorical-proton.lean#L31-L31","doc":"Pair Skein mass S_ud. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.CategoricalProton.skein_uu","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.CategoricalProton.skein_uu","kind":"def","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/categorical-proton.lean#L29-L29","doc":"Pair Skein mass S_uu. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.CategoricalProton.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.CategoricalProton.mk","kind":"ctor","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/categorical-proton.lean#L27-L27","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.CategoricalProton","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.CategoricalProton","kind":"structure","line":24,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/categorical-proton.lean#L24-L35","doc":"The categorical proton: color-linked triple [u, u, d]_c ⋈ L_H.\nMass = S_uu + 2·S_ud ≈ 938.272 MeV. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:categorical-proton","label":"def:categorical-proton","md":"quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/categorical-proton.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}